<title>USA: Advanced Media sets 1-for-10 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Advanced Media sets 1-for-10 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>BOHEMIA, N.Y. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Media Inc said Friday that its board has approved a 1-for-10 reverse split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The reverse split becomes effective June 30 prior to the opening of trade of the company's common stock on the OTC Bulletin Board, the company said.</p>
<p>Holders shall have a right to payment in cash for fractional interests, the company said.</p>
<p>Advanced Media is a developer of interactive multimedia products for business.</p>
